Meni tole deluje. evaluation naj bo data.frame, ne vektor.

ds0<-0
ds1<-0
ds2<-0
ds3<-0
ds4<-0.3
ds5<-0.7
ds6<-1.1
ds7<-1.2
ds8<-1.5
ds9<-1.9
ds10<-2.1
ds11<-2.2
evaluation <- data.frame(ds0, ds1, ds2, ds3, ds4, ds5, ds6, ds7, ds8, ds9, ds10, ds11)
dates <- c(1:11, 14)
absolute <- audpc(evaluation = evaluation, dates = dates, type="absolute")
absolute
[1] 14.2

Primer 2 pa ne dela, ker nimamo objekta disease.severity.

lp,
Roman

